:: Widgets Colosseum Breeding [widget]
<!--
	Underground Colosseum breeding layer.
	- The winner of a bout breeds the loser. Pills follow the body: the Bull dose is Blue for a body with no penis
	  and Gray otherwise, the Breeder dose is Pink for a body with no vagina and Gray otherwise. NPCs follow the same rule.
	- House doses run 2 days. A Purple dose (herm effect) already covers both, so nothing is added on top of it.
	- $xchange.colosseum.breed is "", "accept", "deny" or "bred" for the bout in progress. New fields are read with ?? 0.
	- Chastity devices carry origin "Colosseum" and are only ever removed here if they still carry it.
-->
<<widget "colosseumBeltOn">>
	<<if !playerChastity()>>
		<<forceChastityFit "Colosseum">>
		<<set $xchange.colosseum.beltFitted to 1>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "colosseumBeltOff">>
	<<if $xchange.colosseum.beltFitted>>
		<<unset $xchange.colosseum.beltFitted>>
		<<if $worn.genitals.origin is "Colosseum">>
			<<set $worn.genitals to clone(setup.clothes.genitals[0])>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- Give the player a house dose. Arg 1: "bull" or "breeder". Arg 2: "voluntary" when the player chose to swallow it, so Gray Agent does not block it.
	 House gray doses never flip the body, whatever the "Gray pills flip sex" setting says. -->
<<widget "colosseumPlayerPill">>
	<<set _pillBull to _args[0] is "bull">>
	<<set _pillVoluntary to _args[1] is "voluntary">>
	<<set _pillGrayFlip to $xchange.grayPillGenderflip>><<set $xchange.grayPillGenderflip to 0>>
	<<if _pillVoluntary>><<xchange-dose-deliberate>><</if>>
	<<if playerIsXChanged()>>
		<<if !$xchange.pill.hermEffect and !pillIsPermanent()>>
			<<if _pillBull>><<xchange-gray 2 "bull">><<else>><<xchange-gray 2 "breeder" "fertile">><</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif _pillBull>>
		<<if $player.penisExist>><<xchange-gray 2 "bull">><<else>><<xchange-blue 2 "bull">><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $player.vaginaExist>><<xchange-gray 2 "breeder" "fertile">><<else>><<xchange-pink 2 "breeder" "fertile">><</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if _pillVoluntary>><<xchange-dose-deliberate-end>><</if>>
	<<set $xchange.grayPillGenderflip to _pillGrayFlip>>
<</widget>>

<!-- Give an NPC a house dose. Arg 1: "bull" or "breeder". Arg 2: their $NPCList slot. -->
<<widget "colosseumNpcPill">>
	<<set _pillSlot to _args[1] ?? 0>>
	<<set _pillGender to $NPCList[_pillSlot].gender>>
	<<npc-select-xchange-target _pillSlot>>
	<<if _args[0] is "bull">>
		<<if _pillGender is "f">><<npc-take-xchange 2 "genderflip" "bull">><<else>><<npc-take-xchange 2 "bull">><</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if _pillGender is "m">><<npc-take-xchange 2 "genderflip" "breeder" "fertile">><<else>><<npc-take-xchange 2 "breeder" "fertile">><</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- Antidote out, Purple in. Sets $xchangeAntidoteFizzle when the running dose cannot be shifted. -->
<<widget "colosseumPurpleSwap">>
	<<xchange-antidote 7>>
	<<if !$xchangeAntidoteFizzle>>
		<<xchange-restore>>
		<<take-xchange 2 "herm" "breeder" "fertile" "bull">>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Underground Colosseum Intro Finish
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<colosseumHost>>
<<set _loserMale to random(0, 1) is 1>><<set _winnerFemale to random(0, 1) is 1>>
In the pit, the fighter who took the punch stops trying to get up. The other climbs on top, pins both arms to the sand and pushes a hand between the loser's legs. The loser's back arches and they come with their mouth open and the whole room watching.<<arousal 400>><<garousal>>
<br><br>
You find you are gripping the rail. The crowd is on its feet. The chant starts in the front row and spreads back through the seats: "Breed them! Breed them! Breed them!"
<br><br>
Two attendants climb over the barrier. One holds the loser's jaw while the other pushes a <<if _loserMale>>pink<<else>>gray<</if>> capsule into their mouth and keeps it shut until they swallow.<<if _loserMale>> The loser's body has started to change before the capsule is gone.<</if>> The winner is handed a <<if _winnerFemale>>blue<<else>>gray<</if>> capsule and takes it without being held down.
<br><br>
A <<person>> in a waistcoat soon pushes through the spectators towards you. <<He>> places a hand around your elbow and pulls you away from the seats.
"You're new. If you're only here to watch, don't stand here too long. The staff will assume you're looking for a fight."
<br><br>
<<He>> leads you towards a desk at the side of the room. A row of wire cages stands behind it. Clothes, shoes, bags, and other personal belongings have been placed inside them.
<br><br>
<<He>> points towards the cages.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Intro 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Breed Offer
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>><<pass 1>>
<<set _bullColour to $player.penisExist ? "gray" : "blue">>
<<set _breedColour to $NPCList[0].gender is "m" ? "pink" : "gray">>
<<unset $xchange.colosseum.breed>>
Your opponent stays down. The referee finishes the count, lifts your wrist and steps back. Nobody in the room sits. The chant starts in the front row and fills the room: "Breed them! Breed them! Breed them!"
<br><br>
An attendant drops two keys and two capsules onto the sand by your feet. One key opens the chastity device on you and the other opens <<his>>. The <<print _bullColour>> capsule is a Bull pill, for you. The <<print _breedColour>> capsule is a Breeder pill, for <<him>>.
<<if playerIsXChanged() and $xchange.pill.hermEffect>>You are still on the Purple dose, so you do not need yours.<<elseif !$player.penisExist and !playerIsXChanged() and !xchangePregnancyBlocksPill() and !xchangePillProtectionActive()>>The blue pill will give you a cock to use.<</if>>
<<if $NPCList[0].gender is "m">>The pink pill will give <<him>> a womb to carry with.<</if>>
<br><br>
The winner is expected to use them. The room waits to see what you do.
<br><br>
<<link [[Take the pill and breed <<him>>|Underground Colosseum Breed Win]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave the capsules on the sand|Underground Colosseum Breed Deny]]>><</link>><<note "The house bans you for good" "red">>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Breed Win
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>><<pass 15>>
<<set _onPurple to playerIsXChanged() and $xchange.pill.hermEffect>>
<<set _hadPenis to $player.penisExist>>
<<set _npcFlips to $NPCList[0].gender is "m">>
<<colosseumPlayerPill "bull" "voluntary">>
<<colosseumNpcPill "breeder" 0>>
<<person1>>
<<colosseumBeltOff>>
You pick up your capsule and swallow it dry.
<<if _onPurple>>
	It adds nothing to what the Purple dose is already doing.
<<elseif !$player.penisExist>>
	You wait for the change, but your body will not take the dose.
<<elseif !_hadPenis>>
	Your hips tighten and something forms between your legs, thick and heavy, until your body treats it as its own.
<<else>>
	Heat spreads down from your stomach and your cock stiffens until it aches.
<</if>>
<<if $xchange.pill.bullEffect>>The need to breed comes with it. Stopping feels like the wrong idea.<</if>>
<br><br>
You unlock your own device first, then <<his>>. An attendant holds <<his>> jaw and feeds <<him>> the other capsule.
<<if _npcFlips>>Within a minute <<his>> body is reshaping itself on the sand: <<his>> hips widen and <<his>> chest softens, and <<he>> stops fighting the change and starts breathing through it.<</if>>
<<He>> is still winded from the bout and does not stop you when you push <<him>> onto <<his>> back. The crowd starts to count out loud.<<if $xchange.pill.bullEffect>> The pill has already made the decision for you.<</if>><<arousal 500>><<garousal>>
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.colosseum.breed to "accept">><<colosseumHeat 2>>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Result]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Breed Deny
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>><<pass 2>>
<<set $xchange.colosseum.breed to "deny">>
You let the keys lie where they fell and step back from the capsules.
<br><br>
For a few seconds nothing happens. Then someone in the front row starts booing, and the rest of the room follows. Betting slips land on the sand around you.
<br><br>
A microphone crackles. The announcer apologises to the room for "a difficulty with the winner" and promises the next bout will be worth the wait. By the gate, three goons stop watching the crowd and start walking towards you.<<colosseumBackDown 80>><<stress 6>><<ggstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Result]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Breed Loss
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>><<pass 15>>
<<set _oppFemale to $NPCList[0].gender is "f">>
<<set _breedColour to $player.vaginaExist ? "gray" : "pink">>
<<set _hadVagina to $player.vaginaExist>>
<<colosseumNpcPill "bull" 0>>
<<person1>>
