<<set _playerFlips to !_hadVagina and $player.vaginaExist>>
<<colosseumBeltOff>>
Your legs will not hold you. The referee counts you out, lifts your opponent's wrist and leaves the sand. The chant begins before the gate has closed: "Breed them! Breed them! Breed them!"
<br><br>
An attendant drops two keys and two capsules beside your opponent, not beside you. Two more pin your arms. A hand closes your nose until you open your mouth, and a <<print _breedColour>> capsule goes in. They hold your jaw shut until you swallow.
<<if _playerFlips>>Your body changes on the sand while they hold you: your hips widen, your chest fills out, and a wet heat opens low in your belly.<</if>>
<<He>> swallows the other capsule without being held, then opens your chastity device with one of the keys.
<br><br>
<<He>> is not in a hurry. You cannot push <<him>> off<<if $xchange.pill.breederEffect>>, and the pill has already made your body answer before you do<</if>>.<<arousal 500>><<garousal>><<stress 10>><<ggstress>>
<br><br>
<<set $xchange.colosseum.breed to "bred">><<set $xchange.colosseum.bredPending to 1>><<set $xchange.colosseum.bredBirths to $pregnancyStats.playerChildren>>
<<famesex 15 "none" true>><<fameexhibitionism 6 "none" true>><<colosseumHeat 2>>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Result]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Colosseum Deny Goons
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<pass 1>>
<<generateRole 0 "brisk" "guard">><<generateRole 1 "heavy" "guard">><<generateRole 2 "bored" "guard">>
<<controlloss>><<violence 1>><<neutral 1>><<maninit>>
<<set $enemyanger += 100>>
The three goons reach you together. The one in front says nothing and swings. There is no referee on this side of the barrier, and your clothes are in a cage on the far wall.
<br><br>
