:: Colosseum Deny Goons Result
<<effects>><<pass 5>>
<<set _victory to $enemyhealth lte 0 or $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
<<set $xchange.colosseum.ending to "walked">><<set $xchange.colosseum.banReason to "refused">>
<<if _victory>>
	The last goon goes down against the cages. You take your clothes from the cage, force the delivery door with your shoulder and run up the ramp into the alley.<<famescrap 6 "none" true>>
	<br><br>
	Behind you, an attendant is already taking your name off the board. <span class="red">The house has banned you for good.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Leave|Industrial Alleyways]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You end up on the concrete with your arms over your head. The goons keep kicking until someone tells them to stop, then pick you up by the arms.<<colosseumInjure 2 3>><<trauma 4>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[The goons carry you towards the grey door|Underground Colosseum Detention]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Trial Loss
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<pass 5>>
The goon takes your arm and does not let go.
<br><br>
"Nobody leaves after the trial," the goon says. "Everyone who loses it gets one more bout, against somebody on the card. You're a fighter now, so you get treated like one."
<br><br>
The goon walks you back along the corridor and recites the rules without looking at you. No breeding until the referee has called the bout. Break that rule and you do not walk home. The chastity device stays on until the winner opens it, because nobody is to be made pregnant before the crowd has paid to watch.
The winner gets both keys and both capsules, and does as they like with the loser.
<br><br>
<<link [[Follow the goon to the gate|Underground Colosseum Trial Loss 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Trial Loss 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<colosseumOpponent 0>><<pass 3>>
<<strip>><<colosseumBeltOn>>
<<set $daily.colosseumFights to ($daily.colosseumFights ?? 0) + 1>><<set $xchange.colosseum.mock to 0>><<set $xchange.colosseum.fightStart to 1>><<set $xchange.colosseum.matchRank to 0>><<set $xchange.colosseum.opponentRank to 0>>
The goon stops at the gate and checks the lock on your device against the key, twice. On the other side of the pit your opponent is already waiting, locked into one as well.
<br><br>
The announcer reads out the name the crowd knows you by. Someone near the barrier screams it back. The bell rings and both gates open.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Fight]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Goon Key
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<colosseumHost>><<pass 2>>
<<loadNPC 1 "colosseum_opponent">>
<<person1>>
The goon is on the sand holding the barrier, trying to work out which way is up. The receptionist reaches you first and holds your arm in the air until the room cheers.
<<if $fame.scrap gte 500>>"That's about what I expected from you," <<he>> says.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> puts a small key in your palm. "It opens the goon's belt. The one who tried to drag you in here."
<<He>> looks at the goon and back at you. "You can put the goon back in it, or you can see what that belt was hiding. The house won't mind either way."
<br><br>
<<link [[Take the key|Underground Colosseum Goon Breeding]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Give the key back|Underground Colosseum Goon Key Deny]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Colosseum Goon Key Deny
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "colosseum">><<effects>><<person1>>
The receptionist looks at the key in your hand, then at you, and lets out a long breath when you hold it out.
<br><br>
"Nothing? After that? Somebody like you, leaving all that on the table." <<He>> takes the key and drops it in a pocket. "What a waste. If you change your mind, you know where the door is."
<br><br>
An attendant takes you by the elbow and leads you back along the corridor. The goon is helped off the sand behind you.
<br><br>
<<colosseumBeltOff>><<clotheson>>
<<link [[Next|Underground Colosseum Pit]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

